Package: linux-base-@abiname@@localversion@
Meta-Rules-Target: base
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.linux.nokernel>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux @upstreamversion@ for @class@ (base files)
 This package contains files for Linux @upstreamversion@ on
 @longclass@ that are used for both installing the kernel and building
 additional modules.
